{"s":99,"v":[{"t":"When the earth is shaken with its [final] earthquake","w":[["إِذَا","When","idhā",""],["زُلْزِلَتِ","is shaken","zul'zilati",""],["ٱلْأَرْضُ","the earth","l-arḍu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضُ",35]]],["زِلْزَالَهَا","(with) its earthquake","zil'zālahā","",[["زِلْزَالَ",2406],["هَا",22]]]]},{"t":"And the earth discharges its burdens","w":[["وَأَخْرَجَتِ","And brings forth","wa-akhrajati","",[["وَ",1],["أَخْرَجَتِ",131]]],["ٱلْأَرْضُ","the earth","l-arḍu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضُ",35]]],["أَثْقَالَهَا","its burdens","athqālahā","",[["أَثْقَالَ",1150],["هَا",22]]]]},{"t":"And man says, \"What is [wrong] with it?\" -","w":[["وَقَالَ","And says","waqāla","",[["وَ",1],["قَالَ",16]]],["ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","man","l-insānu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["إِنسَـٰنُ",181]]],["مَا","What","mā",""],["لَهَا","(is) with it","lahā","",[["لَ",8],["هَا",22]]]]},{"t":"That Day, it will report its news","w":[["يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","That Day","yawma-idhin","",[["يَوْمَ",33],["ئِذٍۢ",50]]],["تُحَدِّثُ","it will report","tuḥaddithu",""],["أَخْبَارَهَا","its news","akhbārahā","",[["أَخْبَارَ",1702],["هَا",22]]]]},{"t":"Because your Lord has inspired [i.e., commanded] it.","w":[["بِأَنَّ","Because","bi-anna","",[["بِ",10],["أَنَّ",41]]],["رَبَّكَ","your Lord","rabbaka","",[["رَبَّ",24],["كَ",18]]],["أَوْحَىٰ","inspired","awḥā",""],["لَهَا","[to] it","lahā","",[["لَ",8],["هَا",22]]]]},{"t":"That Day, the people will depart separated [into categories] to be shown [the result of] their deeds.","w":[["يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","That Day","yawma-idhin","",[["يَوْمَ",33],["ئِذٍۢ",50]]],["يَصْدُرُ","will proceed","yaṣduru",""],["ٱلنَّاسُ","the mankind","l-nāsu","",[["ٱل",2],["نَّاسُ",67]]],["أَشْتَاتًۭا","(in) scattered groups","ashtātan",""],["لِّيُرَوْا۟","to be shown","liyuraw","",[["لِّ",8],["يُرَ",298],["وْا۟",3]]],["أَعْمَـٰلَهُمْ","their deeds","aʿmālahum","",[["أَعْمَـٰلَ",183],["هُمْ",3]]]]},{"t":"So whoever does an atom's weight of good will see it,","w":[["فَمَن","So whoever","faman","",[["فَ",7],["مَن",25]]],["يَعْمَ